 # Project rules
 
 This project declares no rules beyond its README.
+
+## Decisions taken
+
+- Cancellation refund (`cancel`): the brief did not give a policy, so this one was assumed and needs the
+  school's confirmation. Full refund with at least 48 h notice before the start, half (rounded down) with at
+  least 24 h, nothing later. Cancelling at or after the end is refused. Cancelled bookings stay recorded
+  (so a second cancel fails) but no longer hold equipment.
